  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-17T15:33:58.982Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be awesome if finger tracking worked on the quest platform (either PC or Mobile).\nWhy relevant:\n- most of the time players are not moving, but just standing, talking, singing etc. Finger tracking would increase immersion and expression big time.\n- Quest 2 is the most used vr headset (biggest playerbase on PC and Mobile)\n- Recently the Finger tracking on quest 2 got vastly improved. \nFrom my own experience It would be fine to use the controllers for moving or navigating the menu and switching to finger tracking when I'm talking to other people or singing karaoke ;D (which is 95% of my VRC time )\nThanks!",
